{
 "turns_text": [
  "[SEG0001] person_1 (PATIENT): Sorry.",
  "[SEG0002] person_2 (DOCTOR): You're totally fine. Uh, we were running behind too. Was it traffic?",
  "[SEG0003] person_1 (PATIENT): Parking.",
  "[SEG0004] person_2 (DOCTOR): Ugh, that garage is awful today. Is the baby out there with your partner?",
  "[SEG0005] person_1 (PATIENT): Yeah.",
  "[SEG0006] person_2 (DOCTOR): Okay. What brought you in today?",
  "[SEG0007] person_1 (PATIENT): Sleep.",
  "[SEG0008] person_2 (DOCTOR): Sleep. Can you give me one more word?",
  "[SEG0009] person_1 (PATIENT): Can't.",
  "[SEG0010] person_2 (DOCTOR): You can't sleep. Even when the baby is sleeping?",
  "[SEG0011] person_1 (PATIENT): Yes.",
  "[SEG0012] person_2 (DOCTOR): Mm. How long has this been going on?",
  "[SEG0013] person_1 (PATIENT): Weeks.",
  "[SEG0014] person_2 (DOCTOR): You're six weeks after delivery, right?",
  "[SEG0015] person_1 (PATIENT): Six.",
  "[SEG0016] person_2 (DOCTOR): I can see you're tearful sitting there. Have you been crying most days?",
  "[SEG0017] person_1 (PATIENT): Yes.",
  "[SEG0018] person_2 (DOCTOR): And your mood, if you pick one word?",
  "[SEG0019] person_1 (PATIENT): Sad.",
  "[SEG0020] person_2 (DOCTOR): I need to ask this directly. Any thoughts of hurting yourself?",
  "[SEG0021] person_1 (PATIENT): No.",
  "[SEG0022] person_2 (DOCTOR): Any thoughts of hurting the baby?",
  "[SEG0023] person_1 (PATIENT): No.",
  "[SEG0024] person_2 (DOCTOR): Thank you for saying it plain. Your partner looked anxious in the hallway. Does he help at night?",
  "[SEG0025] person_1 (PATIENT): Some.",
  "[SEG0026] person_2 (DOCTOR): Any shortness of breath?",
  "[SEG0027] person_1 (PATIENT): Borderline.",
  "[SEG0028] person_2 (DOCTOR): Borderline? Err, I think you answered a different question. Let me ask again. Short of breath, yes or no?",
  "[SEG0029] person_1 (PATIENT): No.",
  "[SEG0030] person_2 (DOCTOR): No shortness of breath. So what was borderline?",
  "[SEG0031] person_1 (PATIENT): Thyroid.",
  "[SEG0032] person_2 (DOCTOR): They told you a thyroid test came back borderline?",
  "[SEG0033] person_1 (PATIENT): Yeah.",
  "[SEG0034] person_2 (DOCTOR): Are you eating much?",
  "[SEG0035] person_1 (PATIENT): Little.",
  "[SEG0036] person_2 (DOCTOR): Still taking the prenatel vitamin?",
  "[SEG0037] person_1 (PATIENT): Yeah.",
  "[SEG0038] person_2 (DOCTOR): Okay, you're still on it, once a day. Do you actually get it every day?",
  "[SEG0039] person_1 (PATIENT): Miss.",
  "[SEG0040] person_2 (DOCTOR): You miss some, that's alright. Umm, your blood pressure today is 118 over 76 and your pulse is 88.",
  "[SEG0041] person_1 (PATIENT): Okay.",
  "[SEG0042] person_2 (DOCTOR): Six weeks out, not sleeping, tearful and sad, my working impression is this may be postpartum depression, more than ordinary baby blues. Not a final diagnosis.",
  "[SEG0043] person_1 (PATIENT): Mm.",
  "[SEG0044] person_2 (DOCTOR): Come back in one week. I'm ordering a repeat thyroid panel today since they called the last one borderline, and I'm referring you to the postpartum support group. Ask your partner to take one night stretch, and if thoughts of hurting yourself or the baby come up, go to the ER or call 911.",
  "[SEG0045] person_1 (PATIENT): Okay."
 ],
